{"id":"otsyuda","lemma":"отсюда","pos":"adv","rank":183,"glosses":["from here, hence"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/41/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%82%D1%81%D1%8E%D0%B4%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%82%D1%81%D1%8E%D0%B4%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Это далеко отсюда?","en":"Is it far from here?","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"far off"},null]},{"text":"Ваш дом далеко отсюда?","en":"Is your house far from here?","words":[{"g":"your, yours"},{"g":"house, building"},{"g":"far off"},null]},{"text":"Ты хочешь отсюда выйти?","en":"Do you want to get out of here?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},null,{"g":"to exit, to go out"}]},{"text":"Помогите мне отсюда выйти.","en":"Help me out here.","words":[{"g":"help!"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null,{"g":"to exit, to go out"}]},{"text":"Я хочу выйти отсюда.","en":"I want to get out of here.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to exit, to go out"},null]}]}